  "as_of": "2017-08-17",
  "sentences": [
   "The bill would change tax on untaxed amounts rolled over between superannuation arrangements where the transferred amount exceeds the person's applicable untaxed plan cap.",
   "It would lift the Medicare levy component of the rate calculation to 2.5 per cent, replacing 2 per cent, while retaining the top marginal rate link.",
   "It would accompany the proposed Medicare levy increase in a wider package intended to help fund the Commonwealth's contribution to the National Disability Insurance Scheme."
  ],
  "changes": [
   "The changed rate would cover excess untaxed roll-over amounts paid from 1 July 2019.",
   "Commencement would align with the companion Medicare levy legislation.",
   "Paragraph 5(2)(b) of the relevant tax imposition Act would be amended."
  ],
  "affected": "People liable for tax on excess untaxed roll-over amounts would be affected.",
